      "mergedPostDetails": "Please provide documentation for VRCImposterEnvironment\n\nI found VRCImposterEnvironment component from list of add-able whitelisted components in VRCSDK but there is no documentation on the [beta docs](https://vrc-beta-docs.netlify.app/).\n\nPlease provide documentation for VRCImposterEnvironment.",
