      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I saw this post earlier but couldn't find it anymore and thought it was either deleted or I just imagined seeing it 😅\n\nSo I ended up making my own [canny](https://feedback.vrchat.com/impostors/p/documentation-for-the-vrc-impostor-environment-component-is-missing).\n\nThis component is not new to the open beta btw, I original found it in the current live sdk, but idk when exactly it was added.",
